1cb363d55db01.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "a oni su se razjedinili", "en": "but they split up", "tr": "ama onlar ayrılığa düştüler", "fr": "mais ils se sont divisés", "id": "lalu mereka terpecah belah", "ur": "اور وہ ٹکڑے ٹکڑے ہو گئے", "bn": "কিন্তু তারা টুকরো টুকরো হয়ে গেল", "fa": "اما آنان پاره پاره شدند"}}, {"text": "أَمْرَهُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بَيْنَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كُلٌّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِلَيْنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَٰجِعُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "2:166", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/173.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "(On the day) when those who were followed disown those who followed (them), and they behold the doom, and all their aims collapse with them.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "O zaman kendilerine uyulan kimseler, azabı görerek kendilerine uyanlardan kaçıp uzaklaşmışlar ve aralarındaki bütün bağlar parça parça kopmuştur.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "جب بیزار ہوں گے پیشوا اپنے پیروؤں سے اور دیکھیں گے عذاب اور کٹ جائیں گی ان کی سب ڈوریں", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "(Yaitu) ketika orang-orang yang diikuti itu berlepas diri dari orang-orang yang mengikutinya, dan mereka melihat siksa; dan (ketika) segala hubungan antara mereka terputus sama sekali.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "إِذْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَبَرَّأَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱتُّبِعُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱتَّبَعُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَرَأَوُا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْعَذَابَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَتَقَطَّعَتْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/3c91d858977c509ffb3a.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "and she/it was cut off", "bs": "i prekinula se", "tr": "ve kesildi", "fr": "et elle a été coupée", "id": "dan dia telah terputus", "ur": "اور وہ کاٹ دی گئی", "bn": "এবং তা বিচ্ছিন্ন হলো", "fa": "و قطع شد"}}, {"text": "بِهِمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْأَسْبَابُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "وَتَقَطَّعَتْ", "count": 1, "first": "2:166", "audio": "audio/3c91d858977c509ffb3a.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "and she/it was cut off", "bs": "i prekinula se", "tr": "ve kesildi", "fr": "et elle a été coupée", "id": "dan dia telah terputus", "ur": "اور وہ کاٹ دی گئی", "bn": "এবং তা বিচ্ছিন্ন হলো", "fa": "و قطع شد"}}, {"arabic": "تَّقَطَّعَ", "count": 1, "first": "6:94", "audio": "audio/6757d2ecd6381d42c488.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it was cut off", "bs": "prekinuo se", "tr": "kesildi", "fr": "il a été coupé", "id": "dia telah terputus", "ur": "وہ کاٹ دیا گیا", "bn": "সে বিচ্ছিন্ন হলো", "fa": "قطع شد"}}, {"arabic": "تَقَطَّعَ", "count": 1, "first": "9:110", "audio": "audio/bbe6bb6faacb289a1fbf.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "subjunctive"}]}, {"arabic": "وَتَقَطَّعُوٓا۟", "count": 1, "first": "21:93", "audio": "audio/10a17261cb363d55db01.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "a oni su se razjedinili", "en": "but they split up", "tr": "ama onl